n class=\"td-seal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">推</span><span><b>Wong Tuina</b><small>Chinese Medical Massage</small></span></a><ul class=\"r\"><li><a href=\"{{p:master}}\">The Master</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:pricing}}\">Fees</a></li><li class=\"more\"><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">More ▾</a><div class=\"dd\"><div><h4>Clinic</h4><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:services}}\">Treatments</a><a href=\"{{p:constitution}}\">Body constitution check</a><a href=\"{{p:conditions}}\">Conditions we treat</a><a href=\"{{p:master}}\">Master practitioner</a><a href=\"{{p:pricing}}\">Fees</a></div><div><h4>Visit</h4><a href=\"{{p:book}}\">Book a consultation</a><a href=\"{{p:stories}}\">Patient stories</a><a href=\"{{p:contact}}\">Visit the clinic</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></div></div></li><li><a class=\"td-btn\" style=\"padding:.6em 1.2em\" href=\"{{p:book}}\">Book</a></li></ul></div></header>","foot":"<footer class=\"td-foot\"><div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top:54px\"><div class=\"cols\"><div><div class=\"td-logo\" style=\"padding:0;color:inherit\"><span class=\"td-seal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">推</span><span><b>Wong Tuina</b><small style=\"color:var(--c-accent)\">Chinese Medical Massage</small></span></div><p style=\"margin-top:14px;opacity:.8;max-width:32ch\">Three generations of tuina practice, now in Kuala Lumpur. 三代推拿, 傳承至今.</p></div><div><h4>Clinic</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:services}}\">Treatments</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:constitution}}\">Body constitution check</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:conditions}}\">Conditions we treat</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:master}}\">Master practitioner</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:pricing}}\">Fees</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Visit</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:book}}\">Book a consultation</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:stories}}\">Patient stories</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:contact}}\">Visit the clinic</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"copy\" style=\"padding:22px 0\"><span>© 2026 Wong Tuina. Template demo content.</span></div></div></footer>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"td-hero\"><span class=\"td-hanzi\" aria-hidden=\"true\">推拿</span><div class=\"in\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:var(--c-accent);letter-spacing:.4em\">Traditional Chinese medical massage</span><h1>Move the <em>qi.</em><br>Ease the pain.</h1><p>Three generations of tuina practice. Each treatment starts with pulse and tongue diagnosis, so the work fits your body, not a menu.</p><a class=\"td-btn\" href=\"{{p:book}}\">Book a consultation</a> &nbsp; <a class=\"td-btn o\" href=\"{{p:constitution}}\">Take the body check</a></div><div class=\"td-gate\"><div class=\"ph soft\" data-l=\"Master at work (缺图)\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"td-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-ttl\"><small>Treatments · 療法</small><h2>Four ancient methods</h2></div><div class=\"td-grid\"><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">推</div><h3>Tuina massage</h3><p>Rolling, kneading and pressing along meridians to move qi and release tension.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">灸</div><h3>Moxibustion</h3><p>Warming mugwort over acupoints for cold, stiff joints.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">拔</div><h3>Cupping</h3><p>Suction cups to draw out stagnation in the back and shoulders.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">刮</div><h3>Gua sha</h3><p>Gentle scraping to relieve neck and shoulder tightness.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"td-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-prof\"><div class=\"ph soft\" data-l=\"Master Wong (缺图)\"></div><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Master practitioner · 師傅</span><h2 style=\"font-weight:400;margin:10px 0\">Master Wong Kar Heng</h2><p>Replace with the practitioner’s lineage and approach. Third-generation tuina practitioner, trained at the Guangzhou University of Chinese Medicine.</p><div class=\"td-cred\"><div><b>32</b><span>Years practising</span></div><div><b>40k</b><span>Treatments</span></div><div><b>TCM</b><span>Registered</span></div></div><a class=\"td-btn\" href=\"{{p:master}}\">Meet the master</a></div></div></div></section><div class=\"td-q\"><blockquote>“Two years of back pain, and after four sessions I could finally garden again. He explained every point.”</blockquote><cite>— Madam Chong, 67</cite></div><section class=\"td-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-ttl\"><small>Conditions · 病症</small><h2>What we commonly treat</h2></div><div class=\"td-grid\"><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">頸</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Neck & shoulders</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">腰</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Lower back</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">眠</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Sleep</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">頭</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Headaches</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">膝</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Knee pain</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">胃</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Digestion</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">疲</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Fatigue</h3></a><a class=\"td-card\" href=\"{{p:conditions}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div class=\"hz\">產</div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:18px\">Postnatal</h3></a></div></div></section>","services":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Treatments</b></div><h1>Treatments · 療法</h1></div></section><section class=\"td-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-grid\"><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">推</div><h3>Tuina massage</h3><p>Rolling, kneading and pressing along meridians to move qi and release tension.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">灸</div><h3>Moxibustion</h3><p>Warming mugwort over acupoints for cold, stiff joints.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">拔</div><h3>Cupping</h3><p>Suction cups to draw out stagnation in the back and shoulders.</p></div><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">刮</div><h3>Gua sha</h3><p>Gentle scraping to relieve neck and shoulder tightness.</p></div></div></div></section>","constitution":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Body constitution check</b></div><h1>Body constitution check · 體質</h1></div></section><section class=\"td-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-quiz\"><small class=\"eyebrow\">Question 1 of 6</small><h3>How would you describe your hands and feet?</h3><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q\"> Usually cold, even in warm weather</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q\"> Warm, sometimes sweaty</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q\"> Neither — it varies with my day</label><p style=\"margin-top:24px\"><a class=\"td-btn\" href=\"#\">Next →</a></p></div></div></section>","conditions":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Conditions we treat</b></div><h1>Conditions we treat · 病症</h1></div></section><section class=\"td-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"td-grid\"><div class=\"td-card\"><div class=\"hz\">頸</div><h3>Neck & shoulders</h3></div